>  =A0Can I dispose of him without upsetting my God so I can
> still get my gift?

More often than not, the only altar I find is in Minetown, and
crossaligned. So getting rid of a priest, coaligned or not, is a
common treat. I you've bought protection, you don't want to get rid of
him yourself. So upgrade one of your pets. With your magic whistle, it
will be very easy if you find a poly trap. If your resulting pet is
powerful enough - say, a dragon, for example, it will dispose of him.
A poly spell, potion, or wand will be useful too.

An even niftier way is to steal from a shop (if there's one in the
level) and pit the shopkeeper (and the kops hordes) against the priest
if you've got conflict.





